# Chat Bar V1

## Goal

Dead-simple React chat-bar. Assistant messages are rendered from
`ComponentDescriptor` JSON via registry → React components (not raw HTML).

## Stack

- Vite + React 18+ + TypeScript
- Plain CSS only (no Tailwind / MUI / Chakra / Ant / Redux / Next.js)
- Local `useState` only — no live LLM or API backend
- No new deps without asking; `clsx` only if needed

## Architecture

- Extend `src/library/registry.ts` for new UI blocks
- Do **not** one-off JSX in `Message.tsx` for assistant content
- Keep HTML/output deterministic from descriptors
- Unknown descriptor types → `Fallback`; never throw
- Never `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` for message text

## Locked library components

Text, Card, Button, Image, List, Stack (+ Fallback). Do not expand without an explicit ask.

## Safety

- No secrets in the repo
- No Costantino Art archive content
- No family calendar IDs

## Pages

`vite.config.ts` must keep `base: '/chat-bar-v1/'` for GitHub Pages.
